{"id":12205,"artist":"by Ale®","title":"Ho capito che ti amo-Luigi Tenco","lyrics_plain":null,"lyrics_synced":"[00:00.80] Ho ca pi to che ti a mo\n[00:07.20] quando ho vi sto\n[00:09.20] che ba sta va un\n[00:10.80] tuo ri tar do\n[00:13.60] per sen tir sva ni re in me\n[00:16.40] l'in dif fe ren za\n[00:20.00] per te me re che tu\n[00:23.20] non ve nis si piu'.\n[00:26.40] Ho ca pi to che ti a mo\n[00:32.80] quan do ho vi sto che\n[00:35.00] ba sta va un a tua fra se\n[00:39.20] per far si' che un a\n[00:41.40] se ra ta co me un' al tra\n[00:45.60] co min cias se per\n[00:47.80] in can to a il lu mi nar si.\n[00:52.80] E pen sa re\n[00:55.60] che po co tem po pri ma\n[00:58.80] par lan do con qual cu no\n[01:02.00] mi e ro mes so a di re\n[01:05.60] che o ra ma i\n[01:08.40] non sa rei piu' tor na to\n[01:11.60] a cre de re al l'a mo re\n[01:14.80] a il lu der mi e so gna re.\n[01:18.00] Ed ec co che poi,\n[01:20.80] ho ca pi to che ti a mo\n[01:27.20] e gia' e ra trop po tar di\n[01:30.80] per tor na re,\n[01:33.60] per un po' ho\n[01:34.80] cer ca to in me\n[01:36.40] l'in dif fe ren za\n[01:40.00] poi mi son\n[01:41.20] la scia to an da re\n[01:43.60] nel l'a mo re.\n","lyrics_synced_enhanced":"[00:00.80] <00:00.80>Ho <00:01.20>ca <00:01.60>pi <00:02.00>to <00:02.80>che <00:03.00>ti <00:03.20>a <00:03.60>mo\n[00:07.20] <00:07.20>quando <00:07.60>ho <00:08.00>vi <00:08.40>sto\n[00:09.20] <00:09.20>che <00:09.40>ba <00:09.60>sta <00:10.00>va <00:10.00>un\n[00:10.80] <00:10.80>tuo <00:11.00>ri <00:11.20>tar <00:11.60>do\n[00:13.60] <00:13.60>per <00:14.00>sen <00:14.40>tir <00:14.80>sva <00:15.60>ni <00:15.80>re <00:15.80>in <00:16.00>me\n[00:16.40] <00:16.40>l'in <00:17.19>dif <00:17.40>fe <00:17.60>ren <00:18.00>za\n[00:20.00] <00:20.00>per <00:20.40>te <00:20.80>me <00:21.20>re <00:22.00>che <00:22.40>tu\n[00:23.20] <00:23.20>non <00:23.40>ve <00:23.60>nis <00:23.80>si <00:24.00>piu'.\n[00:26.40] <00:26.40>Ho <00:26.80>ca <00:27.20>pi <00:27.60>to <00:28.40>che 